  "title": "Tenable Launches Open Partner Exchange Network (OPEN) to Connect Security Tools, Data and AI-Driven Workflows Across the Enterprise",
  "summary": "Tenable® Holdings, Inc. (NASDAQ: TENB), the exposure management company, today announced the Tenable Open Partner Exchange Network (OPEN), the next evolution of its technology partner ecosystem, designed to help organizations unify security data, accelerate AI-driven workflows, and operationalize exposure management across their existing technology stack.",
